    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ev1_note",
      "x": 1120,
      "y": 1100,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "Why the header lines exist:\n\nBefore they did, a chunk holding this\nwhole table contained no occurrence\nof the word \"warranty\". Neither branch\ncould match a question about it.\n\nThe published fix writes a context\nsentence per chunk with an LLM. The\nbiggest model here is 1.5B, so the\nheading path is used instead: same\neffect, no inference, no hallucination.",
      "originalText": "Why the header lines exist:\n\nBefore they did, a chunk holding this\nwhole table contained no occurrence\nof the word \"warranty\". Neither branch\ncould match a question about it.\n\nThe published fix writes a context\nsentence per chunk with an LLM. The\nbiggest model here is 1.5B, so the\nheading path is used instead: same\neffect, no inference, no hallucination.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
