    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ev3_note",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 2050,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "A cosine similarity and a keyword\nrank are not comparable numbers.\nFusing positions instead of values\nneeds no calibration between the\ntwo branches, and a chunk both\nrank highly beats one that only\none branch found.\n\nRejected on evidence: semantic\nchunking benchmarks worse than\nrecursive splitting, at roughly\n14x the indexing cost.",
      "originalText": "A cosine similarity and a keyword\nrank are not comparable numbers.\nFusing positions instead of values\nneeds no calibration between the\ntwo branches, and a chunk both\nrank highly beats one that only\none branch found.\n\nRejected on evidence: semantic\nchunking benchmarks worse than\nrecursive splitting, at roughly\n14x the indexing cost.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
